    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_ghost_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "566276775F56375E",
      "text": "歡迎光臨冰櫃道館！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_ghost_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "566275775F5635AB",
      "text": "請讓我登記\\n挑戰者的名字……\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，對吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_ghost_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "566274775F5633F8",
      "text": "想和本道館的館主萊姆對戰，\\n就必須先通過道館測驗。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_ghost_010_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "56627B775F563FDD",
      "text": "冰櫃道館的道館測驗是……\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]開場表演[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！\\r\\n……也就是所謂的暖場秀！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_ghost_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "56627A775F563E2A",
      "text": "在道館館主的演唱會開始之前，\\n請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在舞台上進行寶可夢對戰！\\r\\n用火花四濺的決鬥炒熱觀眾席！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_ghost_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "566279775F563C77",
      "text": "只要到演唱會場和主持人說一聲，\\n就可以開始道館測驗囉。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_ghost_010_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "566278775F563AC4",
      "text": "那麼，請慢走！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
